Documentation: VOLNA is a free, open-source iOS music application combining multiple legal music sources into a unified streaming experience. The project is fully native Swift/SwiftUI built following modern iOS development practices. No backend, no database, everything runs locally on the device.

**Current Status (Stage 1 - Foundation Complete):**

✅ **Completed:**
- Project structure created with XcodeGen configuration
- Domain models (Track, Album, Artist, Playlist, StreamSource)
- MusicProvider protocol and ProviderRegistry
- JamendoProvider implementation (basic)
- PlayerService with background audio support
- SearchService with multi-provider and deduplication
- LyricsService (LRCLIB integration)
- LibraryService (local JSON storage)
- Basic UI screens (Home, Search, Library, Settings)
- Design system with VOLNA color palette
- Info.plist with audio background mode
- README with full project documentation
- Research document with API analysis

🔨 **Next Steps:**
- Complete InternetArchiveProvider implementation
- Test Jamendo API integration (need API key)
- Implement actual audio playback (integrate AudioStreaming library)
- Create mini-player component
- Create full-screen player UI
- Add artwork caching
- Setup GitHub Actions workflow
- Generate app icon and assets

The foundation is solid and ready for the next phase of development. The architecture follows best practices with clear separation between providers, services, and UI layers.